  "body": "Downloads  This set of notes is written to be read online, but two downloadable versions are also available for accessibility purposes:  PDF version , typeset for printing.  Word (.docx) version , generated automatically and provided as a convenience — equations and figures may need manual tidying.  Both are regenerated whenever the online version is updated, so they may occasionally lag behind this page. Note that the lecturers will be keeping a close eye on the online notes, and it is not always possible to check the PDF as the course proceeds. If there are severe issues it is helpful to send an email to the lecturers. The Word version is mainly provided for accessibility reasons and typically requires additional help by Accessibility assistance at the University of Bath.  "
